Could we use Monday at 2:00 to confirm whether to start the inspection-record=
 study with the candidate 2,400 records and eight disposition classes?

I would like to read records where the opening status and the final dispositi=
on disagree, and ask whether cutting the text removes the words that change t=
he answer. The opening status can reflect the start of the round rather than =
the action effective at signature. The attached proposal sets out the scope a=
nd the questions for Fatima, Joshua and Emily before we settle the reading ru=
les, partitions or input windows.

I am asking to start the research, not to approve use of a classifier. I prop=
ose keeping its population separate from the short-intake study.

Thanks,
Vanessa

